automx roadmap
==============

- Track successor versions of the Mail Autoconfig, PACC, and OAuth Public
  Clients Internet-Drafts without silently changing the 1.2 contracts.
- Expand Autodiscover v2 only when a stable public specification or proven
  interoperability requirement exists.
- Add real-client interoperability fixtures separately from the deterministic,
  dependency-free baseline E2E stack.
- Evaluate signed Mobileconfig support only with an in-process, secret-safe key
  abstraction and explicit operator demand.

DNS mutation, OAuth client registration, identity-provider behavior, and
mailbox-login testing remain outside automx's product boundary.
